{"id":"resp_802958179146d9bd","created_at":1795618509,"incomplete_details":null,"instructions":null,"metadata":null,"model":"gpt-oss-120b","object":"response","output":[{"id":"rs_83a3ebb00f9fdce3","summary":[],"type":"reasoning","content":[{"text":"We need to produce revised SHACL fixing parse error: prefix \":\" not bound. In original, they used \":vesselCompressorShape\". Should bind default prefix \"\"? In Turtle, prefix \":\" is shorthand for base IRI if declared with @base, not prefix. Need to define prefix for empty prefix, e.g., @prefix : <#> . Or use a proper IRI. Likely should use a custom namespace, like vocab: perhaps \"vessel\". Simpler: change shape name to <#vesselCompressorShape> or define prefix \":\" to something like <https://example.org/>. Use @prefix : <https://example.org/> . Provide. Keep rest unchanged.\n\nAlso ensure sh:targetClass vocab:ship correct. Use property paths with full IRIs.\n\nThus revised SHACL:\n\nAdd @prefix : <https://example.org/> . Or maybe use vocab: prefix as base: Use :vesselCompressorShape with prefix \":\" bound to some base. Let's bind to <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#>. But that already is \"vocab\". So could use @prefix : <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#> . Then :vesselCompressorShape becomes same as vocab:vesselCompressorShape (not existing). It's okay.\n\nI'll add: @prefix : <https://example.org/> . Keep shape at \":vesselCompressorShape\". All other prefixes remain.\n\nReturn block with BEGIN_SHACL ... END_SHACL.\n\n","type":"reasoning_text"}],"encrypted_content":null,"status":null},{"id":"msg_bf5167588d1eeecd","content":[{"annotations":[],"text":"<BEGIN_SHACL>\n@prefix sh: <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#> .\n@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .\n@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .\n@prefix vocab: <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#> .\n@prefix qudt: <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt#> .\n@prefix unit: <http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/> .\n# Bind the empty prefix used in the original shape declaration\n@prefix : <https://example.org/> .\n\n# Shape targeting all ships\n:vesselCompressorShape\n    a sh:NodeShape ;\n    sh:targetClass vocab:ship ;\n    \n    # The ship must have a compressorChargeTime value (QuantityValue)\n    sh:property [\n        sh:path vocab:compressorChargeTime ;\n        sh:minCount 1 ;\n        sh:class qudt:QuantityValue ;\n    ] ;\n    \n    # Universal constraint: charge time must not exceed 1 hour\n    sh:sparql [\n        a sh:SPARQLConstraint ;\n        sh:message \"Compressor charge time must not exceed 1 hour.\" ;\n        sh:select \"\"\"\n            SELECT $this WHERE {\n                $this vocab:compressorChargeTime ?qt .\n                ?qt qudt:numericValue ?val .\n                ?qt qudt:unit unit:HR .\n                FILTER(?val > 1)\n            }\n        \"\"\" ;\n    ] ;\n    \n    # Conditional tighter constraint for IA Super ships requiring reversal\n    sh:sparql [\n        a sh:SPARQLConstraint ;\n        sh:message \"For IA Super ships that require propulsion reversal for astern, the compressor charge time must not exceed 0.5 hour.\" ;\n        sh:select \"\"\"\n            SELECT $this WHERE {\n                $this vocab:compressorChargeTime ?qt .\n                ?qt qudt:numericValue ?val .\n                ?qt qudt:unit unit:HR .\n                $this vocab:iceClass vocab:iceClassIaSuper .\n                $this vocab:propulsionEngineReversalRequiredForAstern true .\n                FILTER(?val > 0.5)\n            }\n        \"\"\" ;\n    ] .\n<END_SHACL>","type":"output_text","logprobs":null}],"role":"assistant","status":"completed","type":"message","phase":null}],"parallel_tool_calls":true,"temperature":1.0,"tool_choice":"none","tools":[],"top_p":1.0,"background":false,"max_output_tokens":16000,"max_tool_calls":null,"previous_response_id":null,"prompt":null,"prompt_cache_options":null,"prompt_cache_key":null,"prompt_cache_retention":null,"reasoning":null,"safety_identifier":null,"service_tier":"auto","status":"completed","text":null,"top_logprobs":null,"truncation":"disabled","usage":{"input_tokens":67325,"input_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":320,"cache_write_tokens":66992,"input_tokens_per_turn":[67325],"cached_tokens_per_turn":[320]},"output_tokens":803,"output_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":308,"tool_output_tokens":0,"output_tokens_per_turn":[803],"tool_output_tokens_per_turn":[0]},"total_tokens":68128},"user":null,"presence_penalty":0.0,"frequency_penalty":0.0,"kv_transfer_params":null,"ec_transfer_params":null,"input_messages":null,"output_messages":null}